{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and take it. If heavy, move to location. Else do task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToLocation    /> <Condition ID = HasTaskAssigned    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = TaskSubtree    />\"",
